@@ -1111,6 +1111,19 @@ The format of this change log follows the advice given at [Keep a CHANGELOG](htt
 
   For more information see [MDL-87425](https://tracker.moodle.org/browse/MDL-87425)
 
+### quiz_statistics
+
+#### Changed
+
+- The delay before the `\quiz_statistics\task\recalculate` ad-hoc task runs after a quiz attempt is submitted or deleted is now
+  configurable via the new `quiz_statistics/recalculatedelay` admin setting (default: 1 hour), available from
+  `\quiz_statistics\task\recalculate::get_delay()`. The constant `recalculate::DELAY` is now only the default value.
+  `recalculate::queue_future_run()` now de-bounces the task: if a run is already queued for the quiz, its run time is
+  pushed back by the configured delay instead of being left unchanged, so the recalculation only happens once attempts
+  stop arriving. It now always returns `true`.
+
+  For more information see [MDL-88534](https://tracker.moodle.org/browse/MDL-88534)
+
 ### mod_quiz
 
 #### Added
